<title>BRAZIL: Brazil states' securities 42.047 bln reais in Sept.</title>
<headline>Brazil states' securities 42.047 bln reais in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of securities issued by Brazilian states totalled 42.047 billion reais in September, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>The Central Bank said in a statement that total securities held by the states and municipalities were 48.274 billion reais, up 1.79 percent from 47.424 billion reais in August.</p>
<p>The bank added that securities had been issued by 16 of Brazil's 26 states, plus the federal districts.</p>
<p>-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom, 5561 2230358</p>
